{"id":"vod_md_4789","vodId":"4789","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"奇诺之旅","name_cn":"奇诺之旅","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230912-1/e38066dfc0de391a0e0e2c03b7e607d1.jpg"},"summary":"奇诺（前田爱 配音）是个周游列国的旅行者，她的伙伴叫“艾鲁梅斯”，是一辆会说话的摩托车。奇诺和艾鲁梅斯到各个国家旅行，每次都只在该国家待上三天，了解该国的风土人情，三天之后她便离开前往另一个地方。奇诺原本是“大人之国”一个名字不详的少女，该国规定小孩12岁要接受手术成为 “大人”。因为受到旅行者奇诺的影响，她不想变成“大人”，于是骑着艾鲁梅斯逃离了自己国家，从此以奇诺之名开始周游列国……本作是另类的奇幻寓言题材，以单元剧的形式，讲述了奇诺的旅行故事。观众随着奇诺游历各种形形色色的国家，每个国家看似荒诞的风俗背后，是作者对自身世界的思考和追问。本动画改编自时雨泽惠一的轻小说《奇诺之旅》。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-12 09:00:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/YgXPwp2W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/qrRrWW7v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/1ENjphSL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/UiTLjU1F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/VmwHOKKv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/x9kdIro1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/vKpRa1f4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/F6q7x1A8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ei08izy5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/dPlYAW5v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/khwL8sf4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/4Nbn2Vwt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/5zyE00ns/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:18.740Z"}